# Code zones

Before creating files, pick a zone (`docs/dev/CORE_MAP.md`):

| Zone | Path | Rule |
|------|------|------|
| Core | `lib/saju`, `lib/report`, `lib/v1/slim`, active `lib/v2/*` | Minimal diff; `npm run build` must pass |
| Experiment | `tests/`, `sandbox/` | Disposable; no imports from `app/` |
| Dead | `docs/v2` 03B–03E deep specs | No new code; archive/delete later |

**Birth charts:** `resolveBirthTimeForCharts` — unknown time → 12:00; astrology **requires** `birthPlace`.
